# private audit + source-clone workspaces (gate artifacts, not published)
# Note: /audit/* (not /audit/) so the gate manifest below can be re-included;
# the committed manifest is a hash inventory of the PUBLIC vendor trees and
# is what CI materialises — everything else under audit/ stays private.
/audit/*
!audit/vendor-inventory.sha256
/work/
# local install artifacts
/node_modules/
*.log
